    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakunfuntisha cheŋi kuchenzelu chetala, kutala mwishina deluŋa dakuchisu chetala mudi nakwidika meji adi nakuya kumusela, muloŋa kwatala itala datala kumusela. Meji owu adiŋi nakufuma mwishina kumbadi yetala yachikasa chachidiilu, kukabeta kakameŋa kakuchidiilu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena hakuŋidishila njila yachisu chatala kukabeta kakuchimunswa, hakunnyeŋu mwishila njila yahanzi, hakuntwala kuchisu chahanzi, kunjila yachisu chatala kumusela, kutala, kuchikasa chachidiilu hikukwidika meji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chedikiliyi owu iyala namwonji wakweseka nachu muchikasa chindi, hakuya kumusela, hakweseka nkotweli ikombakaji, hakunhitisha mumeji owu, meji ashikili namutupokosu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakweseka cheŋi ikombakaji, hakunhitisha mumeji owu, meji ashikili mumanuŋu. Hakweseka cheŋi ikombakaji, hakunhitishamu, meji ashikili mumbunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkumininaku hakweseka ikombakaji, hikaloŋa kakukaŋanya ami kuhitamu, himeji akusala chakusala, hikaloŋa kakukaŋanya muntu kuhitamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuŋila nindi, Eyi mwana kamuntu, wunamoni tahindi? Hakuntwala nakunfuntisha kuchikumu chakaloŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu chinelili nafunti dehi, kutala, hachikumu chakaloŋa hadi nyitondu yayivulu nankashi niishinadi niishinadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuŋila nindi, Meji awa adi nakwidika, adi nakuya kumutamba wakumusela, akakunkumuka muchana; chakeŋilawu mumeji akaluŋalwiji alumpuka, meji akabalumuka amawahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwejima kukwinza tuloŋotu yuma yayumi yejima yahwilaŋa kumu yakahanda. Kwakekala inshi jasweja kuvula, muloŋa meji owu anashiki dehi kwenoku, nimeji amukaluŋalwiji akabalumuka amawahi, niyuma yejima yakahanda kwonsu kukwinza kaloŋaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwakemanaŋa akwakuta anshi. Kufumisha kuEngedi kushika nikuEneŋelayimi kwakekala kuwanyikilu watuleŋi. Inshi jawu jakekala mwomwekalila nyitundu yawu, jakasweja kuvula nankashi neyi inshi jamukaluŋalwiji keneni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa kumalowa, nikumachiŋichiŋi hikwakabalumuka kubula kulumpukaku, kwakashala chochina kwikalaŋa muŋwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukaloŋoku, hachikumu chaku, kwakamenaŋa niishinadi niishinadi nyitondu yanyikabu yakudya yejima, mafu ayu hiyakalepukaŋaku, nyikabu yayu hiyakakukaŋaku; kakasoŋeshaŋa nyikabu yayiha mukakweji mukakweji, muloŋa meji aku afumaŋa mumalala. Nyikabu yayu yakekalaŋa yakudya, nimafu ayu akekalaŋa akudukaŋa nachu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta Yehova nindi, Tiyenu mwakekalila ŋinza yimwakaambula nachu ituŋa diikalaŋa dakuswanaŋa mwaya nyichidi yawaIsarela ikumi nayiyedi; Yosefu masekindi ayedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakadiswanaŋa chakwesekana antu ejima hohamu. Muloŋa ami nasanyikili dehi nami, Nakayinkadu ankakulula jenu. Ninodu ituŋidi dakekalaŋa denu dakuswanaŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu mwakekalila ŋinza yetuŋa. Kukabeta kakuchimunswa yakafumi kukaluŋalwiji keneni, yakahiti njila yakuHeteloni, nikuwiŋililu wakuZedadi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nikuHamati, nikuBerota, nikuSibirayimi wekala hakachi kaŋinza yaDamakasa naŋinza yaHamati; nikuHazeri Hatikoni wekala kuŋinza yaHawurani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi ŋinza yakufuma kukaluŋalwiji yakekali yowu Hazari Enani kuŋinza yaDamakasa, nikukabeta kakuchimunswa kutalisha kwokuchimunswa kudi ŋinza yaHamati. Weniwu diwu mutamba wakukabeta kakuchimunswa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumutamba wakumusela, hakachi kaHawurani naDamakasa naGileyadi, netuŋa daIsarela, kwakekali diyi Yodana. Mwakafumisha kuŋinza yakukabeta kakuchimunswa, mwakeseka ndo nikukaluŋalwiji kakumusela. Diwu mutamba wakumusela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutamba wakukabeta kakuchidiilu watala kuchidiilu, wakafumi kuTamari, wakashiki nikumeji akuMeriboti Kadeshi, nikukakaloŋa kaEjipitu, wakahiti nikukaluŋalwiji keneni. Diwu mutamba wakukabeta kakuchidiilu watala kuchidiilu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutamba wakumujika wakekali yowu kaluŋalwiji keneni, kufumisha muŋinza yakukabeta kakuchidiilu, nakutwala ndo nikwatalaŋana nakuwiŋililu wakuHamati. Diwu mutamba wakumujika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenomu dimu mwakabalwila ituŋidi mwahita nyichidi yawaIsarela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakadibalula nachinjikijilu chakusakula nachu, kulonda dakekali wuswana wenu, hamu nawantu akwacheŋi akashakama mukachi kenu akasemena anyana mukachi kenu. Wenawa akekalaŋa kudenu neyi enimbu mukachi kawanyana kaIsarela. Akekalaŋa nawuswana wawu hamu nanenu mukachi kanyuza yawaIsarela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
